    "text": "Texas\nTexas Uber Ride Goes Viral for Skipping Airports Entirely\nBy Joanna Barba,\n1 hours agoIf you've ever driven through the state of Texas, then you know that it's not entirely entertaining. Some cities are so far apart you could be driving eight hours and still not be there. But there are times where you'd think it's completely acceptable to drive than fly, but one Texas man took it to a whole new level by getting an Uber to take him from Dallas to Austin!",
